0 Fixture: the same axle, one part later, now locked.
0 Expected: clean.
0
0 bad-axle-in-round-holes-only.ldr with the dark-green 2x4 brick added under
0 the plate. 39789 has three vertical CROSS holes at x=-20, 0, +20, so the
0 axle at x=-20 now passes through the plate's round hole and its splines
0 bite the brick beneath. That single joint is what retention means: the
0 axle cannot turn and cannot pull out, so the beam it carries stays on.
0
0 The axle's other two joints are still free-running round holes, and that is
0 fine -- NOT RETAINED asks whether ANY joint grips, not whether all of them
0 do. A bearing hole and a locking hole on one shaft is the normal Technic
0 arrangement, and the drone's drive axle is exactly that: free in the blue
0 beam it spins in, locked in this brick.
0
0 The black friction peg at x=-60 is the other half of the real rotor: ribbed,
0 so the plate's round hole grips it, and there is no cross hole out there for
0 an axle to use anyway. Two fasteners, two different reasons they hold.
